 (flagged by semgrep).\n\n## Vulnerability\n| Field | Value |\n|-------|-------|\n| **ID** | gitlab.bandit.B313.B314.B315.B316.B318.B319.B320.B405.B406.B407.B408.B409.B410 |\n| **Severity** | HIGH |\n| **Scanner** | semgrep |\n| **Rule** | `gitlab.bandit.B313.B314.B315.B316.B318.B319.B320.B405.B406.B407.B408.B409.B410` |\n| **File** | `doc/tools/doc_status.py:10` |\n| **Assessment** | Defensive hardening |\n\n**Description**: Found use of the native Python XML libraries, which is vulnerable to XML external entity (XXE)\nattacks. The Python documentation recommends the 'defusedxml' library instead. Use 'defusedxml'.\nSee https://github.com/tiran/defusedxml for more information.\n\n\n## Threat Model Context\n\nThis is a CLI tool - exploitation requires the attacker to control arguments or input files passed to the tool.\n\n## Changes\n- `doc/tools/doc_status.py`\n\n## Behavior Preservation\nThe change is scoped to 1 file on the vulnerable path; it only tightens handling of untrusted input and leaves valid inputs unaffected.\n\n---\n*This patch removes an exploit primitive — a code pattern that, while not independently exploitable today, could be chained with other weaknesses by automated exploit-development tooling. Proactive removal of such primitives raises the bar against increasingly capable automated attack tools.*\n\n---\n*Automated security fix by [OrbisAI Security](https://orbisappsec.com)*\n","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":6051509301,"node_id":"LA_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABaLK0NQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/spam","name":"spam","description":"","color":"E94A26","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-08-25T01:38:18Z","updated_at":"2026-08-25T04:53: